{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01616","headline":"杂曲歌辞 蓟门行五首 四 · 高适","name":"杂曲歌辞 蓟门行五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茫茫长城外，日没更烟尘。\n胡骑虽凭陵，汉兵不顾身。\n古树满空塞，黄云愁杀人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}